{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/na10bm58","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":48,"top":148,"width":864,"height":355},"name":"Submission content","text":"An AI-assisted surplus food recovery workflow for donors and recipient organizations.\n\nDonors publish prepared food with portions, dietary details, pickup location, and a deadline. RescueFlow finds eligible recipients, ranks feasible offers, and keeps rematching any quantity that remains available.\n\nThe system combines deterministic allocation rules with Gemini-generated explanations. The model explains decisions; it does not decide eligibility or allocate food.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Google Sans Flex","color":"#202124","alignment":"left"}}
