{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/v2dkrils","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":48,"top":145,"width":864,"height":360},"name":"Submission content","text":"01  Donation publishing — food type, quantity, dietary details, pickup location, and deadline.\n\n02  Eligibility and ranking — hard filters first, then a weighted feasibility score.\n\n03  Safe portion allocation — acceptance revalidates stock and recipient capacity before reserving.\n\n04  Recovery loop — declines and expired invitations return the remaining quantity to matching; a scheduled worker handles timeouts.\n\n05  Pickup tracking — confirmation and completion are recorded after allocation.\n\n06  Operations and trust — admin recovery queue, audit events, recipient review, and donor feedback.\n\n07  AI explanations — Gemini summarizes why an offer is feasible; matching remains deterministic.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Google Sans Flex","color":"#202124","alignment":"left"}}
