{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/o72t0f2p","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":75,"top":145,"width":810,"height":355},"name":"Submission content","text":"FRONT END\nReact · TypeScript · Vite\n\nBACK END\nPython · FastAPI · SQLAlchemy\n\nDATA\nPostgreSQL on Cloud SQL; SQLite supports local/demo workflows.\n\nAI\nVertex AI Gemini for concise, grounded explanations. Deterministic backend logic owns matching and reservation.\n\nGOOGLE CLOUD DEPLOYMENT\nCloud Run API service · Cloud Run timeout job · Cloud Scheduler · Artifact Registry · Secret Manager","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18.2,"typeface":"Google Sans Flex","color":"#202124","alignment":"left"}}
