{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wjmpkzqp","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":75,"top":155,"width":810,"height":300},"name":"Submission content","text":"Usage-based components\n• Cloud Run API and timeout job compute\n• Cloud SQL instance and storage\n• Vertex AI Gemini calls when an explanation is requested\n• Cloud Scheduler executions and supporting logging\n\nNo verified bill of materials or measured monthly spend is available for this prototype. Before a pilot, enable billing reports and measure traffic, database sizing, and Gemini usage against the expected donation volume.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Google Sans Flex","color":"#202124","alignment":"left"}}
