{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/e9sjyxkv","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":68,"top":145,"width":824,"height":350},"name":"Submission content","text":"FUNCTIONAL SAFEGUARDS\n• Allocation is revalidated against remaining stock and recipient capacity.\n• Declines and expired invitations preserve unaccepted portions for rematching.\n• Pickup completion remains a separate state from allocation.\n• Audit events record donation, invitation, response, and recovery transitions.\n\nBENCHMARK STATUS\nNo formal latency, throughput, or load-test results are available yet. The current demo uses synthetic recipient profiles and synthetic distance estimates. A pilot should measure API latency, timeout sweep duration, rematch success, accepted portions, and completed pickups.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":19,"typeface":"Google Sans Flex","color":"#202124","alignment":"left"}}
