{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0b2hk7qt","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":75,"top":155,"width":810,"height":320},"name":"Submission content","text":"1  Replace synthetic distance with live routing and pickup-time estimates.\n\n2  Add reliable email/SMS notifications and recipient response reminders.\n\n3  Strengthen production identity, organization onboarding, and role-based access.\n\n4  Run a small donor/recipient pilot; measure portions offered, accepted, picked up, and recovered after a decline or timeout.\n\n5  Improve operational monitoring for scheduled sweeps, Gemini availability, and database health.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Google Sans Flex","color":"#202124","alignment":"left"}}
