{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8v2p8jyp","slideIndex":14,"position":{"left":75,"top":155,"width":810,"height":315},"name":"Submission content","text":"Track these outcomes during a real pilot\n\n• Portions offered, accepted, and confirmed picked up\n• Share of declined or timed-out offers successfully rematched before deadline\n• Time from donation publication to accepted allocation\n• Pickup completion rate and reasons for failed collection\n• Donor and recipient feedback over repeat uses\n\nThese are proposed measures; no real-world impact results are claimed yet.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Google Sans Flex","color":"#202124","alignment":"left"}}
